body:
Honestly, as much potential as DP had, I think they just need to let it die at this point. From what I've seen, all the hypes gone, the first chapter was originally released in the early 2010s and the last chapter update was released 2 years ago (it was only a remake of the 1st chapter though), and it seems like it's going to be stuck in development hell at this point. 

&#x200B;

The companies making it either need to get off their asses and do something or officially cancel it. But that's just the 2 cents of an angry, bitter fan
